('a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009', (SELECT id FROM public.activity_categories WHERE slug='rooftop-lounges' LIMIT 1), 'aura-skypool-sunset-session', 'Aura Skypool Lounge — Sunset Session', 'The world''s highest 360 infinity pool with panoramic views of the Palm Jumeirah.', 'Experience the iconic Aura Skypool, suspended 200 meters in the air on the 50th floor of the Palm Tower.', ARRAY['360 infinity pool access','Palm Jumeirah skyline views','Premium sun lounger','Welcome champagne cocktail'], ARRAY['Luxury','Views','Instagram-worthy','Romantic'], 'recurring', 240, 120, 'Dubai', 'Palm Jumeirah', 'Aura Skypool', 21, 'Smart casual. Swimwear acceptable with cover-up.', ARRAY['Valid ID','Advance booking required'], ARRAY['Pool access','Sun lounger','Welcome drink','Towel service'], ARRAY['Food and beverages','Spa treatments','Transportation'], true, true, 98, 1247, 'published')
